    <h2>Level 100 walkthrough: every move in order<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 1–3</span>
      <strong>Drag the circus manager's hat (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Drag the circus manager's hat to the first person. Drag the monkey from the tree to the second person. Drag the hammer to the bicycle.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 4–6</span>
      <strong>Drag the unicycle (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Drag the unicycle to the third person. Tap the shaking leaves. Drag the apple on the ground to the third person.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 7–9</span>
      <strong>Drag the bag (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Drag the bag on the head of the person under the tree to the fourth person. Drag the dark cloud to the fourth person. Drag the small one among the fifth entering brothers to the big one.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 10–11</span>
      <strong>Drag the flag hanging (then 1 more)</strong>
      <p>Drag the flag hanging on the circus tent to the fifth entering big one. Drag the horn to the sixth person.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>If your level 100 shows “Expose Cheater”<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
    <p>Brain Puzzle 3 does not hand every player the same scene at the same number: builds and
    install order differ, and both variants are on record. If the banner on your screen reads
    “Find proof he’s cheating”, this is that scene, 18 moves in order:</p>
    <ol class="alt-steps">
        <li>Click the double servings of steak on the table.</li>
        <li>Swipe up the blinds.</li>
        <li>Click the cosmetics on the sink.</li>
        <li>Click the man's briefcase.</li>
        <li>Click the backup phone.</li>
        <li>Click the text message.</li>
        <li>Drag the fishing rod from the painting to under the bed.</li>
        <li>Click the lady's lace pajamas.</li>
        <li>Swipe up the suit pocket.</li>
        <li>Click the two room cards in the pocket.</li>
        <li>Swipe down the bathrobe collar on the man's chest.</li>
        <li>Click the lipstick mark on the chest.</li>
        <li>Swipe up the quilt.</li>
        <li>Click a tuft of golden long hair.</li>
        <li>Click the roses on the nightstand.</li>
        <li>Swipe up on the man’s bathrobe pocket.</li>
        <li>Click the photo necklace.</li>
        <li>Choose “Don’t believe”.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2>FAQ<span class="accent">.</span></h2>

    <details><summary>What is the answer to Brain Puzzle 3 Level 100?</summary><p>In order: 1) Drag the circus manager's hat to the first person; 2) Drag the monkey from the tree to the second person; 3) Drag the hammer to the bicycle; 4) Drag the unicycle to the third person; 5) Tap the shaking leaves; 6) Drag the apple on the ground to the third person; 7) Drag the bag on the head of the person under the tree to the fourth person; 8) Drag the dark cloud to the fourth person; 9) Drag the small one among the fifth entering brothers to the big one; 10) Drag the flag hanging on the circus tent to the fifth entering big one; 11) Drag the horn to the sixth person</p></details>
    <details><summary>Why does nothing happen when I tap in Level 100?</summary><p>Level 100 mixes gestures: 10 drags, 1 taps. Only the tap steps answer a single tap; the rest are drags or swipes. If a tap does nothing, try dragging the object onto the person or thing it belongs to.</p></details>
    <details><summary>My Level 100 looks different from this page. Why?</summary><p>Brain Puzzle 3 does not show every player the same scene at the same number, and both variants are on record. This page leads with “Circus Audition”. If your game shows “Expose Cheater” at level 100, use the second walkthrough on this page.</p></details>

